  "changes": "Subset of Han ideographs first appearing in the N2 vocabulary, excluding characters already taught in N5/N4/N3 and excluding the iteration mark 々. Entries follow first vocabulary occurrence. Up to three existing English senses are retained. A documented explicit sense-order table in scripts/update-n2-kanji.py prioritizes senses useful for the first vocabulary word introducing a character; other source senses follow in their original order. No new English senses are invented. Each priority sense is checked against the full source entry. Whitespace is normalized, Japanese on readings are converted to hiragana, okurigana dots and prefix/suffix hyphens are removed, duplicate readings are removed, and the primary stroke count is used. Dictionary indexes, SKIP codes, and other search codes are not included.",
